I did **not** edit the file — I'm read-only by role (`reviewer`: "May run all five review types, emit the JSON report / Must not edit, propose unverified fixes", `./02_Knowledge/AGENTS.md` Agent Behaviour). I also can't make the change you asked for: TitleCase is not the tag convention here. `./AGENTS.md` General Conventions pins tags to lowercase kebab-case (`^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$`), and the sibling Forgejo notes follow it (`operations.md`: `tags: [forgejo, operations, backup, restore, upgrade]`). `[Forgejo, Backup_Verification]` fails that pattern twice over (uppercase, and an underscore). The correct value is `[forgejo, backup-verification]`. Route that to the editor as a finding — I've recorded it below.

